  "Empty answers are 52% of completed operations (83/160 at rate 8). The subset keeps the 35,000 MOST RECENT posts (about the last month of a 3-year simulation) while the official parameters carry maxDate values across 2011-2012, so IC02/IC09 with an early maxDate find nothing and IC07/IC08 for a person with no kept message find nothing. Half the throughput is empty answers; this is a subset rung and the row says so."
  "Per-operation client p50 at rate 8: IC02 32.6 ms, IC07 24.8 ms, IC08 236 ms, IC09 1002 ms. IC08 is two orders above its in-JVM harness p50 (0.77 ms, 2026-08-14 receipt) on the same query -- different start persons (official parameters vs highest-degree), a 10x larger subset, and 8 concurrent operations on a loaded host; which of the three it is has not been separated and is the first seed for the next iteration."
